<title>BELGIUM: AUDIOLUX SAYS TO CUT AUDIOFINA STAKE.</title>
<headline>AUDIOLUX SAYS TO CUT AUDIOFINA STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxembourg-based holding company Audiolux SA said in a statement on Friday it would reduce its stake in media holding Audiofina following a restructuring of its shareholder structure.</p>
</text>
